<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:37:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>菲律宾火山喷发 火山灰云高达6公里</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/philippines-volcano-erupts-creating-6km-high-ash-cloud</link><description>菲律宾中部的坎拉翁火山于周六喷发，喷出浓烟和火山灰。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/philippines-volcano-erupts-creating-6km-high-ash-cloud.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:37:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/philippines-volcano-erupts-creating-6km-high-ash-cloud</guid></item><item><title>Oncopeptides 根据胶质母细胞瘤机会之窗 (WoO) 研究首批患者的数据证实了血脑屏障渗透性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/oncopeptides-confirms-blood-brain-barrier-penetration-based-on-data-from-first-patients-in-glioblastoma-window-of-opportunity-woo-study</link><description>Oncopeptides AB (publ) 是一家专注于难治性癌症的生物技术公司，今天公布了其正在进行的临床机会之窗 (WoO) 研究 OP-701 (INSULA) 中第一批患者的数据，该研究评估了其在胶质母细胞瘤中的专有肽药物缀合物 (PDC) 平台。前三名接受治疗的患者的数据表明，肿瘤内药物浓度与临床前模型一致，成功穿透人类血脑屏障（BBB），并且具有良好的耐受性，第一位患者迄今为止已接受五个月剂量，没有任何重大药物相关毒性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/oncopeptides-confirms-blood-brain-barrier-penetration-based-on-data-from-first-patients-in-glioblastoma-window-of-opportunity-woo-study2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:22:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/oncopeptides-confirms-blood-brain-barrier-penetration-based-on-data-from-first-patients-in-glioblastoma-window-of-opportunity-woo-study</guid></item><item><title>通过人工智能驱动的形式证明搜索推进数学研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/advancing-mathematics-research-with-ai-driven-formal-proof-search</link><description>几十年来，数学家一直梦想着一个世界，在这个世界里，计算机不仅可以处理数字，还可以真正思考、推理并帮助发现新的真理。然而，一个主要障碍是人工智能臭名昭著的“幻觉”问题：大型语言模型（LLM）听起来很自信，但它们经常犯数学错误，使得它们对于严肃的研究来说不可靠。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/advancing-mathematics-research-with-ai-driven-formal-proof-search2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:07:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/advancing-mathematics-research-with-ai-driven-formal-proof-search</guid></item><item><title>波恩研究人员成功在试管中使人体细胞恢复活力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bonn-researchers-successfully-rejuvenate-human-cells-in-a-test-tube</link><description>波恩大学医院和波恩大学的研究人员在试管中成功地使人体细胞显着恢复活力。为此，他们直接将红细胞前体重新编程为可以衍生神经元的干细胞。在此过程中，指示细胞年龄的分子钟被重置。例如，80岁老人的血细胞被转化为分子年龄不到20年的干细胞。由于这种恢复过程发生得非常缓慢，因此非常适合对潜在机制进行更详细的研究。研究结果发表在《衰老细胞》杂志上。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bonn-researchers-successfully-rejuvenate-human-cells-in-a-test-tube2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:52:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bonn-researchers-successfully-rejuvenate-human-cells-in-a-test-tube</guid></item><item><title>等待了 50 年才获得适当荣誉的数学家去世了</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mathematician-who-waited-50-years-for-proper-credit-for-her-work-has-died</link><description>在洛斯阿拉莫斯国家实验室，Mary Tsingou Menzel 的计算机编程为混沌理论和其他领域奠定了基础。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mathematician-who-waited-50-years-for-proper-credit-for-her-work-has-died.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:37:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mathematician-who-waited-50-years-for-proper-credit-for-her-work-has-died</guid></item><item><title>NASA 约翰逊航天中心的工程师模拟了一座火星推进剂工厂，将火星空气和埋藏的冰转化为 300 吨甲烷和氧气，发电量占其着陆质量的 59%</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/engineers-at-nasas-johnson-space-center-modeled-a-mars-propellant-plant-turning-martian-air-and-buried-ice-into-300-metric-tons-of-methane-and-oxygen-and-power-generation-was-59-percent-of-i</link><description>NASA Johnson 模拟的火星推进剂工厂将在火星一年内将火星空气和埋藏的冰转化为 300 吨甲烷和氧气&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/engineers-at-nasas-johnson-space-center-modeled-a-mars-propellant-plant-turning-martian-air-and-buried-ice-into-300-metric-tons-of-methane-and-oxygen-and-power-generation-was-59-percent-of-i.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:22:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/engineers-at-nasas-johnson-space-center-modeled-a-mars-propellant-plant-turning-martian-air-and-buried-ice-into-300-metric-tons-of-methane-and-oxygen-and-power-generation-was-59-percent-of-i</guid></item><item><title>混合量子计算机在新环境中观察基础量子效应</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/hybrid-quantum-computer-observes-foundational-quantum-effect-in-a-new-setting</link><description>牛津大学物理系的物理学家使用由量子位和量子振荡器组成的混合量子计算机来观察量子模拟中的阿哈罗诺夫-玻姆效应。这种效应是一种量子现象，其中粒子可以通过围绕磁通量运动来获得可测量的相位，即使它从未穿过存在磁场的区域。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/hybrid-quantum-computer-observes-foundational-quantum-effect-in-a-new-setting2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:07:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/hybrid-quantum-computer-observes-foundational-quantum-effect-in-a-new-setting</guid></item><item><title>生物停滞行业自律第1部分</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/biostasis-industry-self-regulation-part-1</link><description>时机合适吗？&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/biostasis-industry-self-regulation-part-1.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:52:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/biostasis-industry-self-regulation-part-1</guid></item><item><title>还记得 Orkut 吗？它的创始人想把它带回来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/remember-orkut-its-founder-wants-to-bring-it-back</link><description>在一个&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/remember-orkut-its-founder-wants-to-bring-it-back.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:37:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/remember-orkut-its-founder-wants-to-bring-it-back</guid></item><item><title>钢铁从来都不是真实的</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-steel-was-never-real</link><description>7 回顾：科学、身体和人工智能之间的墙的倒塌正在如何改变一切。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-steel-was-never-real.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:22:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-steel-was-never-real</guid></item></channel></rss>